> - "What does "You feel aprehencive (sp?) as you sense a pink flash" mean???

	That means you have acquired intrinsic warning.  A 'warned'
character will periodically sense colored flashes relating to the
levels of monsters on the same level.  The colors range from white
(minor opponent) through red (challenging opponent) to black ('yer
gonna die, sucker').  More high-powered monsters cause the flashes to
occur more frequently.

> - How do you stop you pet from attacking friendlies- I was in the the 
>   Gnomish mall, and my pet (who stepped into a polymorph trap and became
>   an Giant)  started slaughtering everyone...

	You can't really, except by physically restraining it.
Locking it in a room or pushing a boulder in front of it would work
for most pets, but not a giant.  Try using a leash.  The only time
this becomes any great concern is when Fido starts bashing
shopkeepers, temple priests, or the Oracle.

